#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:296
msgid ""
"It is also possible to extend other notification types, rather than the :"
"class:`base` class. |br| For example, if you want to extend the :class:"
"`post` notification type instead: |br| you will have to register that as the "
"service's parent: ``parent: notification.type.post`` |br| and extend that "
